Z||000010||Stungbymystang||11-25-2001||09:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by My7Fieros:<BR><B>Yo Stung! You're a member of the Corall forum! I belong to that one to, although Im on it very little. My username on the Corall is "FirstTimeStanger". Welcome to the Fiero Forum!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Cool, what's up man!<BR>What kind of Fiero do you have? I am really considering making a purchase. I need something to kind of tool around in anyway. It seems like this may as well be the car to do it with. Although everytime I see one, they are generally in crap shape, but who knows, maybe I'll get lucky. <P>I'll see ya round.<P><P>------------------<BR>Check Her Out <A HREF="http://hometown.aol.com/xvwannabemevx/home.html" TARGET=_blank>Jade Not Your Average 6</A><BR>94, v6 Auto. 144,220 miles (engine rebuilt @ 139,330)<P>Mods:<BR>K&N, Duals w/flowmasters, Mac 1 5/8 headers<BR>Crank Underdrive Pulley<BR>3.73's<BR>JMS Chip <P>Sounds: <BR>Alpine Head Unit<BR>3 Alpine V12's, 1 JL Audio 500/1<BR>2 JL 12's, 2 Kenwood 6x9's, 2 Kenwood 5x7's, 6 Alpine Tweets||||reg||1
